{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__dsh-sidechain#feature-1","repo":"omdsh-dev/dsh-sidechain","commit":"f1152875ce65a4275e8f8b2b4ac26d4ac8ea205d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Sidechain 的功能「持续侧会话」：`/side <问题>` 从当前会话启动可继续交流的 fork 子线程，继承已完成历史作为参考并接受附件。命令返回子会话 ID，可在独立线程中继续追问。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/commands.ts:40-73","src/side.ts:95-120"]}
